-- shape of one table
                                         Table "public.movies"
   Column    |         Type          | Collation | Nullable |                 Default                  
-------------+-----------------------+-----------+----------+------------------------------------------
 movie_id    | integer               |           | not null | nextval('movies_movie_id_seq'::regclass)
 title       | character varying(80) |           | not null | 
 year        | integer               |           | not null | 
 genre       | character varying(30) |           |          | 
 rating      | numeric(3,1)          |           |          | 
 director_id | integer               |           |          | 
Indexes:
    "movies_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (movie_id)
Check constraints:
    "movies_year_check" CHECK (year > 1900)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "movies_director_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (director_id) REFERENCES directors(director_id)
Referenced by:
    TABLE "movie_cast" CONSTRAINT "movie_cast_movie_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (movie_id) REFERENCES movies(movie_id)

